<script type="application/ld+json" dangerouslySetInnerHTML={{__html:"\r\n{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\r\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\r\n  \"@id\": \"https://dizitaladda.com/courses/expert-digital-marketing-course#faq\",\r\n  \"mainEntity\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n      \"name\": \"What is an expert digital marketing course?\",\r\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n        \"text\": \"An expert digital marketing course, like the one offered at DizitalAdda, is an advanced, industry-level program that trains you in SEO, Google Ads, Meta Ads, analytics, and performance marketing through live projects and real client campaigns.\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Who should join an expert-level digital marketing course?\",\r\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n        \"text\": \"Working professionals, freelancers, business owners, and graduates who already understand marketing basics should join expert digital marketing course to specialize in running real campaigns, managing ad budgets, and leading digital strategy.\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Is an expert digital marketing course better than a short 3–6 month course?\",\r\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n        \"text\": \"Yes — 1 year’s expert digital marketing course covers deeper strategy, live projects, and tool mastery that short 3–6 month courses typically skip, making it better suited for a long-term career or agency-level expertise.\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Is the course available in both online and offline mode?\",\r\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n        \"text\": \"Yes, DizitalAdda's expert digital marketing course is available in both online (live virtual classes) and offline (classroom) mode, so you can choose the format that fits your schedule and location.\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Do you provide recorded sessions if I miss a live class?\",\r\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n        \"text\": \"Yes, at DizitalAdda every live class is recorded and shared with students, so you never lose out on lessons even if you miss a session due to work or personal commitments.\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Will I work on live projects and real brand campaigns during the course?\",\r\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n        \"text\": \"Yes, DizitalAdda's expert digital marketing course includes hands-on live projects and real brand campaigns, giving you practical experience in running SEO, Google Ads, and Meta Ads for actual businesses.\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Does DizitalAdda provide an internship with the Expert course?\",\r\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n        \"text\": \"Yes, DizitalAdda's Expert Digital Marketing Course includes an internship where students apply their skills on live client accounts under mentor guidance before entering the job market.\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Can I do an expert digital marketing course while working or studying?\",\r\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n        \"text\": \"Yes, DizitalAdda's course is designed with flexible online and weekend batch options, plus recorded sessions, making it possible to complete the expert digital marketing course while working or studying.\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Does an expert digital marketing course include live projects and internships?\",\r\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n        \"text\": \"Yes, DizitalAdda's expert-level digital marketing course always includes live projects and an internship component, since real-campaign experience is what separates expert training from basic or theory-only courses.\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n      \"name\": \"I have no marketing or technical background. Can I still succeed in this course?\",\r\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n        \"text\": \"Yes, this course starts with foundational concepts before moving to advanced modules, so students with no prior marketing or technical background can follow along and succeed with consistent practice.\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n      \"name\": \"What jobs can I get after this?\",\r\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n        \"text\": \"After completing expert digital marketing course, you can work as an SEO Executive, PPC/Google Ads Specialist, Social Media Manager, Performance Marketer, Digital Marketing Manager, or start freelancing/agency work.\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Does the course cover SEO, Google Ads, Meta Ads, and performance marketing in depth?\",\r\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n        \"text\": \"Yes, expert digital marketing course covers SEO, Google Ads, Meta Ads, and performance marketing in depth, with dedicated modules, live campaign practice, and tool-based training for each.\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n      \"name\": \"What is Answer Engine Optimisation (AEO) and is it covered in the course?\",\r\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n        \"text\": \"Answer Engine Optimisation (AEO) is the practice of optimizing content to appear in AI-generated answers on tools like Google AI Overviews, ChatGPT, and Perplexity. Yes, AEO is covered in DizitalAdda's expert course as part of the advanced SEO module.\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n      \"name\": \"What is the difference between a basic, advanced, and expert digital marketing course?\",\r\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n        \"text\": \"At DizitalAdda, a basic course covers fundamentals, an advanced course adds strategy and tool depth, and the expert digital marketing course adds live projects, internships, agency-level campaign management and also cover all the fundamental and advanced-level features.\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Who are the hiring partners of the Expert Digital Marketing programme?\",\r\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n        \"text\": \"After DizitalAdda's Expert Digital Marketing programme, students get placement support through tie-ups with digital marketing agencies, startups, and e-commerce brands actively hiring for SEO, PPC, and performance marketing roles.\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Can I upgrade from a basic or advanced course to the expert course later?\",\r\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n        \"text\": \"Yes, students who complete a basic or advanced digital marketing course at DizitalAdda can upgrade to the Expert Digital Marketing Course with adjusted fees and credit for prior learning.\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Is the internship paid or unpaid, and is it in-house?\",\r\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n        \"text\": \"The internship included in DizitalAdda's Expert Digital Marketing Course is in-house and project-based, giving students real client exposure and also a paid internship.\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n      \"name\": \"What tools and software will I get hands-on training on?\",\r\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n        \"text\": \"At DizitalAdda, you'll get hands-on training on Google Ads, Meta Ads Manager, Google Analytics (GA4), SEMrush, Ahrefs, Google Search Console, Canva, WordPress, and Google Tag Manager.\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n      \"name\": \"What is the fee for an expert digital marketing course in India?\",\r\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n        \"text\": \"Expert digital marketing course fees in India range from ₹30,000 to ₹2.5 lakh, depending on duration, live projects, and placement support. Most comprehensive 12-month programs with certification and internship fall between ₹80,000 and ₹1,20,000.\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n      \"name\": \"How do I choose the best digital marketing institute in Delhi?\",\r\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n        \"text\": \"To choose the best digital marketing institute in Delhi, check for live project experience, placement support, updated curriculum (SEO, Google Ads, Meta Ads, AI tools), and trainer credentials - not just brand marketing. Institutes like DizitalAdda that offer live campaigns, internships, and 1-on-1 mentorship typically deliver stronger job-readiness than institutes teaching theory alone.\"\r\n      }\r\n    }\r\n  ]\r\n}\r\n"}} />


 

  
